      "position": [
        50,
        50
      ],
      "params": {
        "text": "# CharmLite - A Minimal Affective Network\n\nThis is a stripped-down version of Noodlings' CharmNetwork.\n\n## To Do and Notice\n\n1. **Multi-timescale**: Fast, medium, and slow processing paths\n2. **Temporal hierarchy**: Different rates of change\n3. **Affect head**: Outputs continuous PAD values\n\n## The CharmNetwork Architecture\n\nFull CharmNetwork has:\n- Fast LSTM (16-D): Seconds - immediate reactions\n- Medium LSTM (16-D): Minutes - mood\n- Slow GRU (8-D): Hours/days - personality drift\n\n~54K parameters, ~2-3ms inference.\n\n**Challenge**: Trace how a single input affects all three timescales.",
        "width": 450,
        "show_on_start": true
      },
      "inputs": {},
      "outputs": {},
      "weights": {},
      "collapsed": false,
      "color": "#5c4a3d",
      "tags": [],
      "description": "Tutorial introduction"
    }
